        "TileImage": "$($repository 293579a3-b1d9-415a-ad3f-9f876892d9b1).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rYour target is Orson Mills, our client; who has decided to remain anonymous under the nickname &quot;Mantis&quot; originally contracted Orson for an assassination on Rico Delgado&#39;s brother, H&#233;ctor Delgado, unfortunately for him, it looks like Orson and two other assassins originally contacted by Mantis decided to take advantage of them and make a run for it with the money.\r\rUnfortunately for them on the other hand, you&#39;ve been contracted to tie up loose ends.\r\rIntel places Orson and his partners in crime at a militia safehouse in New Zealand, Mat Ivers and Shane Minett know each other very well and can often be seen together, additionally, the safehouse isn&#39;t very big so Mr Mills can&#39;t be far off from your secondary targets.\r\rGood luck 47, I&#39;ll leave you to prepare",
        "GameVersion": "8.22.0.83",
